  Object.assign(translations.en, {"Tentang":"About","Tentang proyek":"About the project","Tentang replika":"About the replica","Replika independen, dengan sumber yang dapat ditelusuri.":"An independent replica, with traceable sources.","Website ini merupakan konsep antarmuka dan pengembangan teknis independen yang merujuk pada informasi publik SMK Negeri 1 Mandau. Website ini bukan kanal resmi dan tidak mewakili pihak sekolah.":"This website is an independent interface design and technical development project based on publicly available information from SMK Negeri 1 Mandau. It is not an official channel and does not represent the school.","Tujuan":"Objective","Mengembangkan pengalaman informasi sekolah":"Developing the school's information experience","Proyek ini digunakan untuk mengeksplorasi struktur informasi, aksesibilitas, desain responsif, dan arsitektur website berbasis konten.":"This project explores information architecture, accessibility, responsive design, and content-based website architecture.","Bukan situs resmi":"Not the official website","Tidak dikelola, disahkan, atau mewakili SMK Negeri 1 Mandau. Untuk layanan dan keputusan sekolah, gunakan kanal resmi.":"This project is not managed, authorized, or affiliated with SMK Negeri 1 Mandau. For school services and decisions, use official channels.","Bukan sumber operasional":"Not an operational source","Arsip dan data dapat berubah. Informasi jadwal, penerimaan murid, persyaratan, dan kontak harus diperiksa kembali pada sumber asli.":"Archives and data may change. Verify schedules, admissions, requirements, and contact information with the original source.","Sumber dapat ditelusuri":"Traceable sources","Ringkasan konten disertai rujukan publik. Ketidakpastian tanggal pembaruan atau status data dinyatakan secara terbuka.":"Content summaries include public references. Uncertainty about update dates or data status is stated openly.","Minim pengumpulan data":"Minimal data collection","Pilihan tema disimpan di penyimpanan lokal browser. Website tidak memerlukan akun pengunjung untuk membaca konten.":"Theme preferences are stored in the browser's local storage. Visitors do not need an account to read the content.","Sumber informasi":"Information sources","Rujuk publikasi aslinya":"Refer to the original publication","Konten profil, program keahlian, arsip pengumuman, serta daftar personel ditranskripsikan atau diringkas dari halaman publik yang dicatat dalam register sumber.":"Profile content, vocational programs, announcement archives, and staff lists were transcribed or summarized from public pages recorded in the source register.","Buka situs resmi sekolah":"Visit the school's official website","Catatan verifikasi":"Verification notes","Daftar personel mengikuti nama dan peran yang dipublikasikan sumber; masa berlaku jabatan belum dikonfirmasi.":"The staff list follows the names and roles published by the source; current appointment status has not been confirmed.","Pengumuman lama ditampilkan sebagai arsip, bukan sebagai informasi yang masih berlaku.":"Older announcements are displayed as archives, not as current information.","Informasi yang tidak didukung sumber primer yang memadai tidak ditambahkan sebagai fakta.":"Information not supported by adequate primary sources is not added as fact.","Register dan tanggal pemeriksaan sumber tersedia pada dokumentasi proyek.":"The source register and review dates are available in the project documentation.","Baca register sumber":"Read the source register","Arsitektur teknis":"Technical architecture","Static-first, modular, dan ringan":"Static-first, modular, and lightweight","Teknologi dipilih berdasarkan pekerjaan nyata di website. Tidak ada compiler atau runtime bahasa lain yang dipasang hanya untuk dipamerkan.":"Technologies are selected for actual work on the website. Compilers or runtimes for other languages are not installed just for display.","Rendering halaman statis dan struktur situs.":"Static page rendering and site structure.","Komponen interaktif yang membutuhkan state browser.":"Interactive components that require browser state.","Interaksi browser, pengendali tema, dan pemeriksaan tipe.":"Browser interactions, theme control, and type checking.","Design tokens, lima mode tema, dan layout responsif.":"Design tokens, five theme modes, and responsive layout.","Runtime development dan pipeline build.":"Development runtime and build pipeline.","Pemeriksaan kode dan build otomatis.":"Automated code checks and builds.","Dokumentasi arsitektur:":"Architecture documentation:"});
